---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SubscribeForm from '../components/SubscribeForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="MLStories is a weekly newsletter where ML/AI concepts are taught through storytelling."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">about mlstories</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-slate-600">
    Most ML content is either too academic or too shallow. MLStories sits in the
    middle — rigorous enough to be useful for practitioners brushing up on
    concepts, engaging enough that a non-technical person can follow the plot.
    Every model, metric, or system becomes a character. Every concept becomes a
    story.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-slate-600">
    One new story drops every Monday, across three tracks: ML/AI Concepts,
    Evaluation, and ML/AI Ops. Each one comes with a short quiz to check what
    stuck.
  </p>

  <section id="subscribe" class="mt-12 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">get new stories in your inbox</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">One email a week. No spam, no fluff.</p>
    <div class="mt-6">
      <SubscribeForm />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
